      "review_time_hk": "2026-10-02T02:03:38+08:00",
      "rating": 1,
      "text": "In these recent App updates, you keep changing the layout. It makes it hard to locate. Why makes it not easy for user to use? And the fonts because very small. The app is unable to enlarge. OMG ! Why make it difficult????\n\n\nFeel like crazy. This is unable to find and unable to read. Is this updated not going for user to use??? If I want an urgent suspense of my credit card due to suspected Scam Now get no way to read and no where to find. This is really a very poor App  update  and poor design ever seen from any of Bank App",
      "title": "Ms Chau",
      "source_url": "https://apps.apple.com/hk/app/sc-mobile-hong-kong/id445795688?l=en-GB&see-all=reviews&platform=iphone"
